---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Acupressure for Health Conditions" description="Browse acupressure treatment guides for common health conditions. Step-by-step protocols for nausea, anxiety, headaches, back pain, and more." breadcrumbs={[{ "label": "Home", "href": "/" }, { "label": "Conditions", "href": "/conditions/" }]}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6"><h1 class="mb-4">Conditions</h1><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg mb-10">Targeted acupressure protocols for common health conditions. Each guide recommends specific points and provides step-by-step treatment instructions.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8"><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-nausea" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Nausea &amp; Morning Sickness</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Inner forearm and leg points for natural nausea relief</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-anxiety" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Anxiety &amp; Stress</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Forehead, wrist, and hand points for calming the mind</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-headache" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Headaches</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Hand, neck, and foot points for tension headache relief</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-migraine" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Migraine</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Neck, temple, and hand points for migraine management</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-back-pain" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Back Pain</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Leg, foot, and shoulder points for back pain relief</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-neck-pain" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Neck Pain</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Shoulder, neck, and hand points for neck tension</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-constipation" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Constipation</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Leg, hand, and abdomen points for digestive regularity</p></a><a href="/conditions/acupressure-for-sleep" class="block border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-emerald-400 dark:hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors bg-white dark:bg-stone-800/50"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-1">Sleep &amp; Insomnia</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Wrist, calf, and forehead points for better sleep</p></a></div></div>
</BaseLayout>
